RLVM: include the standard stream header in its diagnostic callers.

These translation units use std::cerr and previously received its declaration
through unrelated Boost headers. Include <iostream> directly. Diagnostic
behavior and upstream RLVM copyright/GPL-3.0-or-later notices are unchanged.

diff --git a/src/systems/base/gan_graphics_object_data.cc b/src/systems/base/gan_graphics_object_data.cc
